; i1-a-u-agree-01 - expression matrix: context i1, value set A, runtime
; error checking off, 3 cells
; agreement cells: the value a recorded rule or the exact result gives, which the
; originals and the port give
; generated by exprmatrix expect from
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/matrix.txt (tools/exprmatrix/README.md);
; do not edit
!TestCase{cells}
  vs$="AB"
  Dim ia.l(300)
  For ii.l=0 To 300 : ia(ii)=ii*16+1 : Next
  vv.l=0
  vv=ia(vs$ <> vs$) : !CheckEq{vv,1,"i1-ne-s-s-A"}
  vv=ia(vs$ < vs$) : !CheckEq{vv,1,"i1-lt-s-s-A"}
  vv=ia(vs$ > vs$) : !CheckEq{vv,1,"i1-gt-s-s-A"}
!EndTestCase
